-*   **Memory Complexity:** Depends on the number of Gaussians $N$ [S2]. The method maintains two sets of Gaussians (dynamic and static), potentially increasing memory usage compared to single-set methods, but the static set avoids deformation field queries [S2].
-*   **Measured Performance:** Achieves 96 FPS real-time rendering on an NVIDIA RTX 3090 GPU at 480x270 resolution [S2].
